        grok:Large_Language_Model,
        grok:Machine_Learning ;
    grok_prop:released "2022" ;
    rdfs:comment "An AI chatbot developed by OpenAI based on the GPT architecture. It can engage in conversational dialogue and assist with various tasks." .

